{#- A finding's text with its backtick spans as code, built from finding_spans() so the reviewer's words stay escaped; or the given words when no text was recorded. Only a caller that cut the text passes cut, so an ellipsis the reviewer wrote closes no mark. -#}
{%- if finding.text is null %}{{ missing }}{% else %}{% for span in finding_spans(finding.text, cut ?? false) %}{% if span.code %}<code>{{ span.text }}</code>{% else %}{{ span.text }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif -%}
